# Images belong on releases, not in git.
#
# A content-only vendor_boot is 12.9 MB; the zero-padded variant is 96 MiB and
# must not even be distributed (it wedges the RP5 ABL on Sending 'vendor_boot',
# issue #54). Publish with scripts/gpu/publish-vendor_boot.sh in the ROM repo.
*.img
*.img.sha256
*.bin
*.tar.gz
*.7z
